<title>JAPAN: Japan Aug service price index down 0.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Aug service price index down 0.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's corporate service price index (CSPI) in August fell 0.7 percent from a year earlier to 102.0, the Bank of Japan (BOJ) said on Friday.</p>
<p>The following are percentage changes in components of the index year-on-year (Y-Y) and month-on-month (M-M):</p>
<p>			     Y-Y   M-M</p>
<p> Overall		   -0.7  -0.1</p>
<p> Finance/Insurance     -0.1   0.0</p>
<p> Real estate	     -2.2  -0.1</p>
<p> Transport		 +0.5  +0.4</p>
<p> Information services  -0.1   0.0</p>
<p> Communications	  -2.4  -0.1</p>
<p> Advertising services  +1.3  -1.9</p>
<p> Lease/rental services -4.9  -0.3</p>
<p> Other services	  +0.2   0.0</p>
</text>
